    {
      "duration_ms": 10500,
      "caption": "Declaration timing and forward references need care: collect declarations before resolving bodies.",
      "narration": "Declaring twice in one scope is an error. C makes a name visible after its declarator, and mutual recursion needs declarations collected before bodies resolve.",
      "elements": [
        {
